        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43979</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43979"/>
        <updated>2026-05-02T03:26:06.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13959985?u=c9ed763913289f3328a467148f1c4bbe09e93e7a&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Explain that the example uses theProtoObj and handler without declaring them, which may lead to a ReferenceError when copied directly. Add explicit variable declarations to make the example self-contained and runnable.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">The current example may confuse readers, especially beginners, because it assumes the existence of variables that are not defined in the snippet. Making the example self-contained improves clarity and ensures it works when copied and tested directly.</p>



]]></content>
