<h2 dir="auto">Translations</h2>
<p dir="auto">Translations are provided as starting drafts and need review by L10n maintainers for each locale (de, es, fr, ja, ko, pt-BR, ru, zh-CN, zh-TW).</p>
<h2 dir="auto">Test plan</h2>
